@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy";
}
<section class="shell content-page">
    <div class="form-panel">
        <h1>Privacy</h1>
        <p>Sign in to browse or manage your collection. The site uses cookies to protect sign-in and account actions.</p>
        <p>Personal collections are private by default. If you create a sharing link, anyone with it can view your username, catalog details and sleeve photos until you replace or turn off the link.</p>
        <p>The site stores your username and a password hash for sign-in. Your email address is used to confirm registration and send password reset links.</p>
        <p>Opening Spotify or loading its player connects your browser to Spotify.</p>
        <p>When a record has a cover hosted elsewhere, your browser loads it from that image provider.</p>
        <p>This application uses Discogs’ API but is not affiliated with, sponsored or endorsed by Discogs. ‘Discogs’ is a trademark of Zink Media, LLC.</p>
        <h2 class="policy-heading">About this site</h2>
        <p>The Record Room was created by @SiteBrand.Creator. @SiteBrand.Copyright applies to the site’s original content. Album artwork and other third-party material remain the property of their respective rights holders.</p>
    </div>
</section>
